* Diodes Inc. BZT52C8V2 nominal coefficients.
* Source: https://www.diodes.com/spice/download/853/BZT52C8V2.spice.txt
* PROXY: the schematic BOM selects MDD, not Diodes Inc.
* Same nominal voltage does not establish identical I-V/temperature behavior.
* Terminals A K. Internal VZ=6.59 must NOT be changed to 8.2.
.SUBCKT DI_BZT52C8V2 1 2
D1 1 2 DF
DZ 3 1 DR
VZ 2 3 6.59
.MODEL DF D (IS=25.1p RS=33.6 N=1.10 CJO=38.4p VJ=0.750 M=0.330 TT=50.1n)
.MODEL DR D (IS=5.02f RS=3.45 N=2.23)
.ENDS DI_BZT52C8V2
